  "guid": "com.jero.traderjeronimo",
  "name": "Trader Jeronimo",
  "slug": "trader-jeronimo",
  "teaser": "I sell ammunition boxes, used weapons and buy some things",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/EksjIKO3vv3r1mVmDQ5N91M1t4cSsJEiZjHC50zf.jpg",
  "downloads": 9119,
  "favourites_count": 5,
  "description": "<p>Simple trader mod that sells ammo boxes (meta ammo) and used weapon presets. The selling price is the handbook value minus 5%.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Buys the following items at a price close to other traders:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Weapons</li>\n<li>Ammo</li>\n<li>Ammo Box</li>\n<li>Magazine</li>\n<li>Weapon Mods</li>\n<li>Assault Scope</li>\n<li>Optic Scope</li>\n<li>Special Scope</li>\n<li>Compact Collimator</li>\n<li>Collimator</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p>Weapon Presets</p>\n<p>Weapons with 70 durability:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Custom AKS-74UN</li>\n<li>Custom M4A1</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Weapons with 80 durability:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Colt M4A1 5.56x45 assault rifle USASOC-I</li>\n<li>Kalashnikov AK-74N 5.45x39 assault rifle Magpul</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Weapons with 90 durability:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Colt M4A1 5.56x45 assault rifle T.O 2K24</li>\n<li>SIG MCX .300 Blackout assault rifle T.O 2K24</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Weapon with 100 durability:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>TheAkGuy AK-50</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p>Suggested mods:\n<a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2402/ammobox1x1\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">AmmoBox1x1</a>\n<a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/1089/kaeno-traderscrolling\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">TraderScrolling</a></p>\n<hr />\n<p>Ammo Tier List from <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.eft-ammo.com/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://www.eft-ammo.com/</a></p>\n<hr />\n<p><em>New weapon presets will be added in the future</em></p>\n<hr />\n<p>For modders, if you want to use this trader to sell your items, the traderID is <strong>68f581fb978611acbb3d5094</strong>. Your PostDBModLoader must be at least +3.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>📁<strong>Installation</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Drag folder from zip file directly into your SPT install folder</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/34vXXDj.gif\" alt=\"Install Mod\" /></p>\n",
